.TH ZVM-VERSION 1 "August 2026" "ZVM v0.9.4" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zvm-version \- print the installed ZVM version
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zvm version
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the installed ZVM release version and target operating system and
architecture, for example
.BR "zvm version v0.9.4 linux/amd64" .
The global
.B zvm --version
option prints the same version and platform information.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zvm (1)
